Z||000005||fierospeeder||03-30-2000||02:21 PM||||I use moneyorders if i buy anything, especially on ebay.  Im a cashier, and i know checks or credit cards are just crap.  I know friends that are making a living from writing bad checks.  Its just fake money that doesn't really exist.  Moneyorders have some value because you pay up front.  Its a shame that this happened to another forum member.  I guess no one learned nothing from the previous time.  I appreciate the people to take time to get parts for us, and have take their own time to package it up and send it to you guys.  I just hope that people understand this tends to ruin the trust between us.  I tend to trust the people i see in here all the time, the true fieroist.||||reg||1
